    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      152.85,
      216.01,
      392.85,
      227.08
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PRESCRIPTION ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 68)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.33,
      253.45,
      401.41,
      277.12
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.33,
      291.01,
      401.26,
      314.56
    ],
    "text": "1.(1)This Act may be cited as the Prescription(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.33,
      328.45,
      401.42,
      364.6
    ],
    "text": "(2)The provisions of this Act, other than the provisions ofthis section, shall come into operation on such date as the Ministermay appoint by Order published in the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.33,
      378.49,
      401.28,
      402.04
    ],
    "text": "(3)The provisions of this section shall come into operationon the date on which the Bill becomes an Act of Parliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.33,
      415.93,
      401.41,
      477.04
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 5 of the Prescription Ordinance (Chapter 68) ishereby amended by the substitution for all the words from'' within ten years from the expiration of such time,'' to the end ofthat section, of the words ''within ten years from the date of givingnotice to the debtor.\".",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.33,
      490.93,
      401.27,
      514.6
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala andTamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
